@startuml
title Customer fee confirmation and booking — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|Customer (React or Flutter)|
start
:Enter delivery input;
|Delivery API|
:Authenticate Customer; validate QuoteInput;
if (Authorized and valid?) then (yes)
  :EstimateFee; persist 10-minute owner quote;
else (no)
  :Return 400/401/403;
  stop
endif
|Customer (React or Flutter)|
:Preview fee;
if (Accept fee?) then (yes)
  :CreateParcel with quoteId, total and key;
else (no)
  :Exit; no parcel created;
  stop
endif
|Delivery API|
:Atomic unique key reservation;
if (Same key, different payload?) then (yes)
  :409 conflict; rollback;
  stop
endif
if (Committed identical duplicate?) then (yes)
  :Return original 201 result;
  stop
endif
if (Quote valid and owned?) then (yes)
  :One transaction consumes quote and saves Created,
  price snapshot, history, outbox and response;
  :Return 201;
else (no)
  :409/403; rollback; request new quote if expired;
  stop
endif
|Delivery outbox relay|
:Publish StatusChanged after commit;
if (Broker confirms?) then (yes)
  :Mark outbox sent;
else (no)
  :Keep pending and retry with same eventId;
endif
stop
@enduml
